## Provenance
The data represents undergraduates at UVA's opinions on whether or not a hot dog is a sandwich. It was collected through a survey open from August 28th to August 31st. Respondents were asked whether they were undergraduate students at UVA, their major, and whether they believed a hot dog is a sandwich. The original dataset contained 189 responses. For this analysis, respondents who indicated that they were not UVA undergraduate students were removed because the research question specifically concerns undergraduate students

## Data Dictionary
- Timestamp - Date and time the response was recorded
- Name - Name of the individual
- Undergraduate? - are they an undergraduate student at UVA or not
- Major - Their main area of study
- Is a hot dog a sandwich? - their answer to the question

